'''Torracat''' (Japanese: '''ニャヒート''' ''Nyaheat'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

